      "f2308eb0-879e-409d-8020-5300bb4d2bb0"],
     ", \(q\)]\)}, {\[Alpha],\[Beta],i,j}] represents a form factor with \
Lorentz structure lorentz \[Element] {Scalar, Vector, Tensor, DipoleL, \
DipoleQ}. The chirality of the lepton (quark) current is ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "$Failed"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "6cd8b169-ea52-476a-97d0-5771d1abaa41"],
     ", \(\[ScriptL]\)]\) (",
