    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"88402f01-b493-42b8-9e24-474d603170c0"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f1c04130-071d-41ba-939d-d8d588b82d46"], 
    ButtonBox["Luminosity",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:HighPT/ref/Luminosity"], 
    ButtonBox["Default",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     "Luminosity \[Rule] \[ScriptL]\[ScriptU]\[ScriptM] is an option, that \
can be used for projections, that determines the integrated Luminosity (in ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "$Failed"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "83549d7c-6cbb-431a-8997-a2ae34fe79ce"],
     ", \(-1\)]\)) used for computing EventYield and ChiSquareLHC. The \
default value is \[ScriptL]\[ScriptU]\[ScriptM]=Default corresponding to the \
actual experimental luminosity of the specified search. This option can be \
used with: EventYield, ChiSquareLHC."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"0db252d4-8e29-45a6-9069-1cd9dc176195"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "5a043ebe-6fe6-4c45-9bf2-f9a0718be691"], 
    ButtonBox["RescaleError",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:HighPT/ref/RescaleError"], 
    ButtonBox["True",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     "RescaleError \[Rule] \[ScriptB]\[ScriptO]\[ScriptO]\[ScriptL] is an \
option that determines whether the background uncertainty should be rescaled \
when changing the default luminosity. The default value is \[ScriptB]\
\[ScriptO]\[ScriptO]\[ScriptL]=True, for which the error is scaled as \
\[CapitalDelta]BKG \[Rule] ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "$Failed"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "c7f45f6a-2c95-4558-b789-aa4b865621c1"],
     ", \(projection\)]/\*SubscriptBox[\(L\), \(search\)]\)]\) \
\[CapitalDelta]BKG. If \[ScriptB]\[ScriptO]\[ScriptO]\[ScriptL]=False, the \
relative error for the background, i.e. \[CapitalDelta]BKG/BKG, is kept \
constant. This option can be used with: ChiSquareLHC."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"3d9575f4-38a3-4f2f-a247-fea39c81b2c8"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->1801401312,ExpressionUUID->"59d575eb-5941-4f67-a3e0-c09fd4b3437a"]
}, Open  ]],

